### Update candidate profile
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/candidate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Candidate Updated",
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/test-user",
  "linkedinUrl": "https://linkedin.com/in/test-user",
  "behanceUrl": "https://behance.net/test-user"
}

### Update employer profile
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/users/employer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Test Company Updated",
  "logo": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "description": "Updated company description",
  "websiteUrl": "https://example.com"
}
